<title>ESTONIA: KROON FIXING BY THE CENTRAL BANK FOR MARCH 13/14.</title>
<headline>KROON FIXING BY THE CENTRAL BANK FOR MARCH 13/14.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for 11/12</p>
<p>March. The Estonia kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark</p>
<p>    for 13/14.03.97   last for 11/12.03.97</p>
<p> CZK     0.46724	  0.46933</p>
<p> DKK     2.09677	  2.09764</p>
<p> FIM     2.68006	  2.67703</p>
<p> HUF     0.07678	  0.07707</p>
<p> JPY     0.11086	  0.11126</p>
<p> LTL     3.38739	  3.41769</p>
<p> LVL    23.33661	 23.36427</p>
<p> RUR     0.00238	  0.0024</p>
<p> SEK     1.77172	  1.77679</p>
<p> UAH     7.40864	  7.49334</p>
<p> USD    13.5504	  13.6716</p>
<p> XEU    15.52537	 15.54666</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
